{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0100","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":6,"subject":"math","topic_key":"statistics","total_weight":114,"expected_output":"screening-0100.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2032","source_sha256":"e072d6c1220125ed430be2b2e61737b11306f245f0d2ed31530c2d8c6886820e","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"۱۰ دادهٔ آماری با میانگین $\bar{x}$ و واریانس ۸ داریم، چند داده برابر با میانگین به آن‌ها اضافه کنیم تا واریانس کل داده‌ها برابر ۵ شود؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۲","aspect_ratio":12.5306}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$12$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.4773}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.5909}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.5909}],[{"type":"text","text":"$6$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.7045}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"واریانس داده‌ها برابر ۸ می‌باشد.\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{(x_1-\\overline{x})^2 + (x_2-\\overline{x})^2 + \\cdots + (x_{10}-\\overline{x})^2}{10} = 8 \\Rightarrow k = 80 $$\n$n$ داده برابر میانگین به داده‌ها اضافه می‌کنیم تا واریانس برابر ۵ شود. با توجه به این‌که داده‌های جدید برابر میانگین می‌باشند صورت کسر تغییر نمی‌کند.\n$$ \\sigma_{\\text{جدید}}^2 = \\frac{(x_1-\\overline{x})^2 + (x_2-\\overline{x})^2 + \\cdots + (x_{10}-\\overline{x})^2}{10+n} = 5 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\frac{k}{10+n} = 5 \\Rightarrow \\frac{80}{10+n} = 5 \\Rightarrow 10+n = \\frac{80}{5} = 16 \\Rightarrow n=6 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۲","aspect_ratio":0.2698}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"9ded549fda8ba02d7fe88901a7618892173a53907e14134d4fe379ff3d1c185c","bytes":416},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"46d75da4340cf58d512662c4df46752f5b5caedc60189de3da50ec03104f902d","bytes":474},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"2be43e79eb6696baacec432136f63b283a2df64f09c9172bd7aa80543df5971c","bytes":448},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"2022a5fbecdd606933278701026ec30168be92e3981a584b0631642cafefca66","bytes":104},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/solution_6.webp","sha256":"e39ad957261467bcc917aec4fa82f447a7613c9c8c93d48253fddb64d459d6ca","bytes":23958},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2032/stem_1.webp","sha256":"7a3604e9cf67f4e9bfe736af3a4dfb1c3effa5fbd4fc2df6c1b740a68186c85c","bytes":11182}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2032,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":189,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2033","source_sha256":"7686be7feeb01aaaf0d1d0ab5395f77f614fbf4038c19dac780d54ba080044b9","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر در ۱۰ داده، $20 = \\sum x_i$ و $100 = \\sum x_i^2$ باشد، واریانس کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۳","aspect_ratio":13.9545}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$6$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.4773}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.5909}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.5909}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.7045}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"از رابطه زیر استفاده می‌کنیم:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{\\sum x_i^2}{n} - (\\overline{x})^2 \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2 = \\frac{100}{10} - \\left(\\frac{20}{10}\\right)^2 = 10-4=6 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۳","aspect_ratio":0.1053}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"a10037811e91897a1c30395baca57cc53b68a99e0dacf187953585a85b5048d6","bytes":2000},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"2b326ca6becdd7d48f3daa061caa422e0b479a706a41b1c4c1a507cd97c12431","bytes":2230},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"82e9db267788328c9c2e055d7c30bf53fb734642923a3fe78463fa236b5c9242","bytes":2122},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"9e5653a37a63c125711b05c39c6e5068009a60a51922f5e13dfa984aa4870d3c","bytes":2020},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/solution_6.webp","sha256":"0869828a020aed73211286b704e9291a7d5cc0e41a77e5181e991bc7a9e11bcc","bytes":10298},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2033/stem_1.webp","sha256":"9243c77a9b33250ef9f6b59d952873671b9e5f66b82af2ce3370d232aaa91948","bytes":1904}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2033,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":189,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2034","source_sha256":"07064b089fbfa2a8618f8755595a3a99a273082dea8745ad22745ba3f40f0ae9","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در ۵ داده با واریانس ۴ و ضریب تغییرات $\\dfrac{1}{3}$، جمع مربع داده‌ها کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۴","aspect_ratio":14.2955}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$160$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.7949}],[{"type":"text","text":"$200$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.9231}],[{"type":"text","text":"$240$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.4713}],[{"type":"text","text":"$180$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.9299}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"واریانس داده‌ها ۴ و در نتیجه انحراف معیار ۲ است:\n$$ CV = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\overline{x}} \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{2}{\\overline{x}} \\Rightarrow \\overline{x}=6 $$\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{\\sum x_i^2}{n} - (\\overline{x})^2 \\Rightarrow 4 = \\frac{\\sum x_i^2}{5} - 36 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\sum x_i^2 = 5 \\times 40 = 200 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۴","aspect_ratio":0.1923}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"53917e43c8c552f397cf3940362ec3aed267025ccfb0b214fe2d7c5f00bab6b4","bytes":92},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"bb5e266f909c837ddf7ce13aa2ccdacf9d4d85726ece7ec55861d8504d686bcd","bytes":94},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"3e3de207411f03d82cfd90a8b09ce201fcdd12e9e97970f7f925f8c17776b1c0","bytes":7576},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"cf0c806483035fe1ff89e0084310e35b2e6e6f596db4065629c5984e1d8716d4","bytes":7376},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/solution_6.webp","sha256":"22920479f3069fd46acc253b47df07fd791391db0214074a59fc9a11157f0a02","bytes":18012},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2034/stem_1.webp","sha256":"fe550e33ef4990b7957f064e8887bb672778351b0b2d9e3c6b8b2fa8d38c8b56","bytes":9354}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2034,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":189,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2035","source_sha256":"ef150f00012605e8ff6682f0299ad26000b0973abacb831de61b2477db78c9f0","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر میانگین ۸ دادهٔ آماری ۱۵ و انحراف معیار آن‌ها ۲ باشد، جمع مربع اعداد کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۵","aspect_ratio":16.1282}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$152$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.7949}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1768$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.9231}],[{"type":"text","text":"$120$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.4713}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1832$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.9299}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"انحراف معیار داده‌ها برابر ۲ و در نتیجه واریانس برابر ۴ است:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{\\sum x_i^2}{n} - (\\overline{x})^2 \\Rightarrow 4 = \\frac{\\sum x_i^2}{8} - 225 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\sum x_i^2 = 8 \\times 229 = 1832 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۵","aspect_ratio":0.1314}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"6a51b2ab4ecaab69fd0e5fe464fd3145fde434db84c9f295572ac78effa4fb3f","bytes":2274},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"57efb985395e6a86d6a630b5252859bc723c0dae4170ce7b1bb577141b4f76a9","bytes":2350},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"a66f6712f7e0b0dc2a9c15b604cd0a16ea275e9bf586d10051c0eafd8f336602","bytes":3824},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"38e3a50f60cd0e84fb23432dab40aee1f06111f8b9424388876456697d288e36","bytes":5242},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/solution_6.webp","sha256":"0b8155796dfbe3cf6a00d01afa007910d8e00ef150644edc386b2b71fd52ddfb","bytes":11780},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2035/stem_1.webp","sha256":"7f36cf51efb1ebabd2316a301623ae1fcf7454842de31f6eeba711ffca06091d","bytes":4266}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2035,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":189,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2036","source_sha256":"68d73bf66c4fdf792940d74c94e3549a749e3ff90ba1743f74782b06d6116913","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در ۱۰ دادهٔ آماری میانگین داده‌ها برابر ۴ و میانگین مربع داده‌ها برابر ۲۵ است. ضریب تغییرات داده‌ها چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۶","aspect_ratio":14.2955}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$0/75$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.7949}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.9231}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1/5$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.4713}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2/25$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.9299}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"رابطه دوم محاسبه واریانس:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{x_1^2 + x_2^2 + \\cdots + x_n^2}{n} - \\overline{x}^2 = \\frac{\\sum x_i^2}{n} - \\overline{x}^2 $$\nمربع میانگین - میانگین مربعات = \nابتدا واریانس داده‌ها را محاسبه می‌کنیم:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{x_1^2 + x_2^2 + \\cdots + x_{10}^2}{10} - 4^2 = 25-16=9 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\sigma=3 \\Rightarrow CV = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\overline{x}} = \\frac{3}{4} = 0/75 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۶","aspect_ratio":0.2705}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"319fff3274142b8ee5414c2ec4520c331d80d2e46d8d0a8f91eff7f6fc607016","bytes":2270},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"9d1f1094096ac2e87a25e69e9979d513f43aafeaf7e1bdb7d6c9c86960ee5d3a","bytes":2180},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"f3ae65b0ecb079f1ecaa0ce03cfc3638e16fcad155a9d5c315b49feea2f6005f","bytes":3568},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"f23abcc4592d55393dbc012b106e39c79a5ce21ce69bbc9f5823076c145b1d1e","bytes":4758},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/solution_6.webp","sha256":"ffcb3b8ac3a7739ee6857b770765c26a65c26840b9d553f51ba6b5a4816a29df","bytes":12840},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2036/stem_1.webp","sha256":"7b2f005677a385bc5682a747c7a969125399af1ea0d1084f1746f584ef8be491","bytes":5898}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2036,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":189,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2037","source_sha256":"26b137a46f365e35a351e04087ecd87d969455b0f1eb6f167725f37d5cf4183f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین ۶ دادهٔ آماری ۴ و انحراف معیار آن‌ها ۲ است. اگر میانگین ۴ دادهٔ دیگر ۴ و ضریب تغییرات آن‌ها ۱ باشد، واریانس ۱۰ داده با هم چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۷","aspect_ratio":11.6481}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2/8$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.7949}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.9231}],[{"type":"text","text":"$7/6$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.4713}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8/8$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.9299}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"انحراف معیار گروه اول ۲ است، بنابراین واریانس ۴ است:\n$$ \\sigma_1^2 = \\frac{(x_1-4)^2 + (x_2-4)^2 + \\cdots + (x_6-4)^2}{6} = 4 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow (x_1-4)^2 + (x_2-4)^2 + \\cdots + (x_6-4)^2 = 24 $$\nضریب تغییرات گروه دوم ۱ است:\n$$ CV = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\overline{x}} = 1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\sigma}{4} = 1 \\Rightarrow \\sigma=4 \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2=16 $$\n$$ \\sigma_2^2 = \\frac{(y_1-4)^2 + (y_2-4)^2 + \\cdots + (y_4-4)^2}{4} = 16 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow (y_1-4)^2 + (y_2-4)^2 + \\cdots + (y_4-4)^2 = 64 $$\nحال واریانس ۱۰ داده را به دست می‌آوریم. میانگین هر دو گروه ۴ بوده و در نتیجه میانگین ۱۰ داده ۴ است.\n$$ \\sigma_t^2 = \\frac{\\overbrace{(x_1-4)^2 + (x_2-4)^2 + \\cdots + (x_6-4)^2}^{24}}{10} + \\frac{\\overbrace{(y_1-4)^2 + (y_2-4)^2 + \\cdots + (y_4-4)^2}^{64}}{10} = \\frac{88}{10} = 8/8 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۷","aspect_ratio":0.5575}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"2cae0bdf91d50e4db38e080dcd8ba39b014e5fe850575680027b19687727c53b","bytes":2492},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"f30544aa2df38ffb8d68e3448e8593e59ee3ac60cbe589aa0176cfd894c6ed50","bytes":2118},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"856ae057a9fce3007c3ef1962385ba690cf17e170981e8451dc5f5d6f737c790","bytes":7038},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"dd40874fcfcaeb42a7df25b9e8e9c9341b4a7c7cda994b7e6463067ab0b98e86","bytes":7588},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/solution_6.webp","sha256":"2035fdab1d5dd0868fc62ddf8ee36c22cea98313e0595b1cd445f213ba9278cf","bytes":41704},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2037/stem_1.webp","sha256":"b54630eedee668b5533500b3b4793e9169711ef253304f87e57ecdbb6d8548a4","bytes":15568}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2037,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":189,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
